	(text "LED indicators: +5V -> LED -> R -> MCU pin, active low.\nPC1, PC4, PC5 must be OPEN-DRAIN outputs: never push-pull,\nnever analog (5V-tolerant only in digital mode).\nRed and yellow: 470R. Green: 2.2k. Sink current <= 8 mA\n(DS8626 Rev 12, Table 49: V_OL 0.4 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 113.284 82.042 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7710fa63-b053-4df3-9675-f3c594abc996")
	)
	(text "References: DS8626 Rev 12 (Table 7: note 5, FT not valid in analog mode; \nTable 12: max sunk current per pin; Table 49: output voltage levels)."
